{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13230000","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13230000","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1323000001:1":{"text":"데이먼, 너를... 믿을게.","source_cn":"戴蒙，我……我相信你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48265D81BE3DFE37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1323000002:1":{"text":"...엄마?","source_cn":"……妈妈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7789755CFCB64C37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1323000003:1":{"text":"네 아빠 말이 맞아. 우리가 잘못한 거였어. 우리가 너에게 강요했던 사랑이 너를 고통스럽고 슬프게 했겠지, 그렇지?","source_cn":"也许你爸爸说得对，我们一直都做错了。我们强加给你的关爱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6271546DF7C3BA5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1323000004:1":{"text":"미안해, 그건 엄마의 본심이 아니었어...","source_cn":"对不起，这不是妈妈的本意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9B056EFE902FFD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1323000005:1":{"text":"나는 네가... 행복하기를 바랐는데.","source_cn":"我希望你……快乐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2109FF94FC0F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1323000006:1":{"text":"엄마...","source_cn":"妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A52BA3C5E65A855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1323000007:1":{"text":"약속할게. 가서 친구들을 사귀고 즐겁게 놀면서, 네가 하고 싶은 일을 마음껏 하렴...","source_cn":"我答应你的请求。去和那些年轻人交朋友吧，去开心地玩耍，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F8EF81E973876E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1323000008:1":{"text":"가도 좋아. 엄마와 아빠는 너를 막지 않을 거란다.","source_cn":"去吧，我和爸爸不会再拦着你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x502422AC2228CF7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1323000009:1":{"text":"정말이에요?!","source_cn":"真的吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DAF31F51909CF92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1323000010:1":{"text":"당연하지. 하지만 무모하게 굴지 않고, 다른 사람을 해치지 않겠다고 약속하렴. 멋진 마법을 배웠으니 너도 이제 강한 그레이브본이란다.","source_cn":"当然。但你也得答应我，不要鲁莽冲动，不要伤害他人——瞧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD56C3D2B469250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1323000011:1":{"text":"네, 약속할게요!","source_cn":"嗯！我答应妈妈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA11E0DCFEC81689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1323000012:1":{"text":"그리고... 위험한 모험은 하지 말렴. 만약 가야겠다면 그전에 엄마 아빠에게 꼭 말해주겠니?","source_cn":"还有……不要做过分冒险的行为——或者，在冒险之前告诉我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C99413F9DB894D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1323000013:1":{"text":"네!","source_cn":"好！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x367D6C06183E5879","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"데이먼","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}